# Optional. Sim Clash plays fully without any key.
#
# With an ElevenLabs API key the announcer can also speak each player's NAME ("ROBIN WINS!")
# in the same voice as the shipped lines: the name is rendered once and kept on disk.
# Without a key the announcer says "PLAYER ONE" / "PLAYER TWO" instead.
#
# Copy this file to .env (git-ignored) and fill in the key, or set the environment variable
# ELEVENLABS_API_KEY, or point BIRDIE_VOICE_ENV at any env file that has this line.
# The key is only ever sent to api.elevenlabs.io and is never logged or written anywhere.
ELEVENLABS_API_KEY=
